Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:07.560
A judge has permanently blocked Donald Trump
from using military funding to build his stupid

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.560
border wall.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.599
This is being reported by slate.

00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:17.750
A federal judge in Texas ruled against Donald
Trump wanting, trying to take three point

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:23.369
$6 billion from military construction funds
to build the border wall.

00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:29.099
A permanent injunction has been made to block
Donald Trump trying to do this or doing it

00:00:29.099 --> 00:00:35.180
on the basis that the executive branch, which
is where Donald Trump exists, does not have

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:40.180
the constitutional authority to take money
that has been appropriated by Congress.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:47.010
The judge in this particular case was district
court judge David Briony's, a Clinton appointee,

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.351
which of course is going to be the subject
of Donald Trump.

00:00:49.351 --> 00:00:55.250
And Trump is saying, look at these terrible
bias people has made a permanent what was

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:58.989
previously a temporary injunction from October.

00:00:58.989 --> 00:01:05.390
This according to the Washington post, is
quote, the first instance of a local jurisdiction

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:11.259
successfully suing to block construction of
Donald Trump's border barrier.

00:01:11.259 --> 00:01:14.200
Now there's a few things that I want to talk
about here.

